                            <Border Tag="{PluginSettings Plugin=ThemeOptions, Path=Options[TopPanelShowThemeSettingsButtons], FallbackValue={StaticResource TopPanelShowThemeSettingsButtons}, TargetNullValue={StaticResource TopPanelShowThemeSettingsButtons}}"
